cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this repository as a research proposal and evaluation protocol. No experimental results or paper publication are claimed."
type: software
title: "RSI-Audit: A Proposal for Budget-Constrained Auditing of Self-Improving Coding Agents"
version: "0.1.0-proposal"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rita2126top-alt/rsi-audit-proposal"
url: "https://github.com/rita2126top-alt/rsi-audit-proposal"
authors:
  - name: "rita2126top-alt"
    website: "https://github.com/rita2126top-alt"
abstract: >-
  Proposed evaluation of reused validation panels, disjoint one-use panels,
  and a terminal validation gate for persistent coding-agent harness
  improvement with a frozen open model and independent final auditing.
  This version contains a proposal, preregistration draft, and verified
  references. GPU experiments have not been executed.
keywords:
  - agent evaluation
  - self-improvement
  - adaptive validation
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
